+/* Optional PCM output-consumption clock. Counts are interleaved sample frames,
+ * not scalar channel samples. They reset on each successful audio open.
+ * This boundary is backend consumption, NOT hardware/speaker presentation.
+ * observed_us marks the most recently published completed device callback (or
+ * open before its first callback), in a backend monotonic epoch: compare deltas
+ * only. Pull publication can lag during reader contention; cumulative counters
+ * catch up on the next publication and Close flushes the final ledger.
+ * queued_frames includes feeds accepted since that callback. All counters are
+ * queried together with no partially completed callback visible.
